Subject: Generator: hybrid (long suffix-match) drafting as an instance wrapper

New file exllamav3/generator/hybrid_draft.py: a port of upstream dev's hybrid draft mode (e72a906d69, "Drafting:
Add hybrid draft mode", -hdt), packaged as install_hybrid_drafting(generator, hybrid_draft_tokens). It wraps the
generator instance's drafting method instead of editing generator.py, job.py and model_init.py. When a job's
current suffix has an earlier match of at least H tokens whose continuation agrees with the regular draft, the
round's draft becomes that H-token continuation, and all rows are padded to H for the rectangular verify pass.
The differences from upstream are listed in the module docstring.

